      "writtenOn": "2022-12-08T11:23:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only difference here would be if iface is null and oldLp is not, we would log errors below: `loge(\"Setting MTU size with null iface.\");`. \nBefore this CL, those logs would have been avoided when MTU was identical. \nArguably, maybe those error logs should be happening?\n\nNote: I think vpn sends link properties with null ifaces as a normal behaviour. Maybe it shouldn\u0027t?",
      "parentUuid": "c6d3b7f9_f67c1401",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3118,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3122,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "a423e63302873b07c657bdace63ab6375cedb50e",
